module for the original copyright and contributor list.

Synced from fork github.com/novoj/RoaringBitmap, commit f27cd538,
which corresponds to upstream RoaringBitmap v1.6.12 (base commit 952f8ce7).
Upstream master has been reviewed through commit ba92f497 (effective
coverage v1.6.16); see UPSTREAM_SYNC.md for the per-commit sync ledger.

Modifications by FG Forrest, a.s. for evitaDB:
  - Vendored only the subset of classes required by evitaDB (see CLOSURE.md).
  - Package renamed from org.roaringbitmap to io.evitadb.roaringbitmap.
  - Reshaped to a single persistent bitmap per data type:
      * PersistentRoaringBitmap     (32-bit, was RoaringBitmap; absorbs the
        copy-on-write / structural-sharing behavior prototyped in
        CopyOnWriteRoaringBitmapV2 - binary operations share unchanged
        container references and mutations clone shared containers lazily).
      * PersistentLongRoaringBitmap (64-bit, was Roaring64Bitmap).
  - Dropped the org.roaringbitmap.buffer (Mutable/Immutable/Mappeable) and
    org.roaringbitmap.insights packages, and the FrozenRoaringBitmap and
    FastRankRoaringBitmap classes, as unused by evitaDB.

